      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "this table should contain\nthe following info twice\n(original and final) :\n\nQty, thickness\n\nhorizontal_bars {\n- Qty\n- Space\n- Width\n- Thickness\n}\n\nvertical_bars {\n- Qty\n- Space\n- Width\n- Thickness\n}\n\nsince both these tables are\nexactly the same, maybe\nmake a separate table for\nit!\n",
      "fontSize": 20.43058353968268,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "this table should contain\nthe following info twice\n(original and final) :\n\nQty, thickness\n\nhorizontal_bars {\n- Qty\n- Space\n- Width\n- Thickness\n}\n\nvertical_bars {\n- Qty\n- Space\n- Width\n- Thickness\n}\n\nsince both these tables are\nexactly the same, maybe\nmake a separate table for it!\n",
